  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude). This brick is a NON-FUNCTIONAL / empty template: the referenced download, unzip and build stage scripts are absent, dvc.lock has no stages, and no upstream URL or license is recorded anywhere in the repo. The name 'dude' suggests it was intended to package DUD-E (dude.docking.org), which the sibling brick 'dud-e-docking-decoys' covers and which itself has restrictive custom terms (free to use / academic, copyright UC Regents, no commercial grant). Because this repository contains NO source or license evidence, it is honestly classed unknown / commercial unknown. HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED: determine whether this brick is an abandoned duplicate of 'dud-e-docking-decoys' (recommend deprecating/merging), or confirm its actual intended source; if it is DUD-E, apply the restricted/prohibited verdict from the dud-e-docking-decoys manifest.",
